id = "tidecursed_diver"
display_name = "Tidecursed Diver"
description = "What the sea keeps of the divers who went past the squeeze line without a breather. It still dives when it fights -- rake, ropy drag, a hull-barnacled body that loathes the surface light. The kelp net it trails snags whatever the tide took: fibers, pearls, and the salvage that never got hauled back up."
